                "fallback": "Next Market Live #2 Spain agenda | Eugene Ernoult",
                "text": "The fastest way to fail in Spain :es: ? Treating it like an extension of France (or Italy, or Portugal).\n\nAt Weglot, we often see founders make the same mistake: assuming \"Southern Europe\" is a single market and that English is sufficient to close deals in Madrid or Barcelona.\n\nOn January 27, we’re breaking down exactly how to crack the Spanish market at Next Market Live #2.\n\nI’m thrilled to moderate sessions featuring leaders from Malt, PayFit, Pleo, Ringover ES, Lucca, Fleet, DRIVECO.\n\nWe are going deep on:\n\n • Trust: How to look local from Day 1\n\n • Traction: Moving beyond your first 10 customers\n\n • Scale: When (and how) to layer in more channels\n\nIf you're expanding to Spain (or thinking about it), don't guess. Come steal the playbooks that worked!\n\nWhether you join us in Paris or on the live stream, you’ll leave with a roadmap, not just theories.\n\nSign up link in comments :point_down:",
